        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDSR40, 4 Inch Rectangular Baseboard Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4 Inch Contemporary Rectangular Baseboard Bumper is a great way to finish up your mid-century modern house remodel. It comes in all the top finish choices including satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. The 4 Inch Half-Cylinder Tip Baseboard Door Bumper allows for wide or up-right installation. It comes packaged with the mounting screw and is easy to install.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDSR40-specifications.gif?v=1704354534\" width\"600\" height=\"183\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BDSR40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BDSR40 Rectangular Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Heigth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Can be mounted wide or up-right.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDSR40-specifications.pdf?v=1691095336\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BDSR40 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
