                "title": "4 Inch Rectangular Baseboard Door Bumper",
                "description": "4 Inch Contemporary Half-Cylinder Tip Baseboard Bumper is a great way to finish up your mid-century modern house remodel. It comes in all the top finish choices including satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. The 4 Inch Half-Cylinder Tip Baseboard Door Bumper allows for wide or up-right installation. It comes packaged with the mounting screw and is easy to install.",
